6006..6082 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6083..6157 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6158..6234 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6235..6309 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6310..6318 Comment "/// `g`."
